### API base URL. Start the Spring Boot application before running these requests.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create content. Copy the returned id into @contentId below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API 학습",
  "description": "Spring Boot CRUD 구현"
}

### Set this value to the id from the create response before running the remaining requests.
@contentId = 2

### 2. List all content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents

### 3. Read one content
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}

### 4. Replace both fields (PUT requires title and description)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API 전체 수정",
  "description": "PUT으로 모든 필드를 교체합니다"
}

### 5. Update only the title (omitted description keeps its previous value)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PATCH 제목만 변경"
}

### 6. Confirm the description was preserved by PATCH
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}

### 7. Delete content (204 response has no body)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}

### 8. Missing ID returns 404 with a JSON error body
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/999999999

### 9. Blank title returns 400 with a JSON error body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "description": "제목 검증 오류"
}

### PATCH rules: omit unchanged fields; explicit null and an empty patch return 400.
### Requests run in order; create a fresh content and update @contentId before rerunning after delete.
